# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# REAL TAX DATA — never commit. This repository is PUBLIC.
#
# The benchmark harness ships a committed TEMPLATE whose own instructions say
# to copy it to `2025.REAL.return1.json` and fill in your actual figures from
# your professionally-prepared return. TaxOS gitignored that filename; this
# repo did not, so following the template's own instructions would have
# published a complete tax return. Year-agnostic on purpose — 2026 and every
# season after it are covered without anyone remembering to add a line.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
rules/fixtures/benchmark-returns/*REAL*.json
!rules/fixtures/benchmark-returns/*REAL*.template.json

# The operator's real-names list for the document masker, under either
# project's name (the file is local-only and never needed by the app).
.taxos-mask.json
.taxfs-mask.json
